Dear All:
I just analysed some aerial survey data with the CDS analysis engine using the bootstrap variance estimation option to get the confidence intervals for my estimates. I ran the standard 999 bootstrap checked the box to create a file of statistics for the bootstrap resamples.

So far so good; until I looked at the DistanceBootstrap.txt that was generated.  This file has 10 unlabelled columns with 29,008 entries in each column.

Can anybody tell me what I'm looking at?

Thanks,
Stuart

